# The build context is the REPO ROOT (docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .), so BuildKit reads this file through
# its sibling `Dockerfile.dockerignore` (a symlink to it). Allowlist: send only what the image COPYs.
*
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/app/
!amd/system1/triage/
!amd/system1/data/kit/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
